# Word of Command (CR 723.2, 107.3a, 119.4): Fire Covenant's X is paid in life ("as an additional cost, pay X life"), so the
# mana Bot2's three lands could make is no bound on it: Bot1 announces X as 18 at 20 life, divides it all onto its own
# Ornithopter, and Bot2 pays 18 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Word of Command
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Swamp
Swamp
Fire Covenant
Island x16

